@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Validation failure returns 422 problem details
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
box "Frontend — Angular SPA (state and API client)" #E0F2FE
  participant "HttpTodoApi" as client
end box
box "Backend — Laravel API (HTTP layer)" #D1FADF
  participant "routes/api.php" as routes
  participant "StoreTodoRequest" as req
  participant "TodoController" as ctrl
  participant "Exception rendering (bootstrap/app.php)" as errors
end box
client -> routes : POST /api/v1/todos with a body that has no title
routes -> req : Resolve Form Request for the matched route
req -> req : Validate title and collect failures
req -> errors : Raise validation exception before the controller runs
note right of ctrl : The controller is not invoked
errors -> errors : Map failures to errors.title as a list of messages (L2-020 criterion 1)
errors -> errors : Build problem details with status 422 and detail (L2-020)
errors --> client : 422 application/problem+json with errors object
@enduml
